  "published": "2026-11-10T17:13:00.813Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 12.1.8 - Updated NuGet package dependencies to latest versions.\n\t\tVersion 12.1.7 - Updated NuGet package dependencies to latest versions.\n\n\t\tPrevious Release (12.1.6):\n\t\t- Updated central package versions for Azure Storage, Aspire Azure Storage, OpenTelemetry, and MudBlazor; bumped DevelopmentHelpers.Storage.Core to 12.1.6; and corrected AzuriteConfig instanceID naming/value.\n\n\t\tVersion 12.1.5\n\n\t\tPrevious Release (12.1.4):\n\t\t- update nuget package dependencies to latest versions (Azure.Storage.Blobs, Azure.Storage.Files.Shares, Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Abstractions, Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection, Microsoft.Extensions.Logging, Microsoft.Extensions.Options.ConfigurationExtensions)\n\n\t\tPrevious Release (12.1.3):\n\t\t- Fixed blob URL parsing (ParseBlobUrl) that could produce an empty blob name and throw\n\t\tArgumentException(\"Value cannot be an empty string. (Parameter 'blobName')\") on Delete/Download/SAS\n\t\toperations. The parser now resolves the container and blob relative to the configured Account.Uri\n\t\tinstead of guessing the layout from the host, which handles Azurite endpoints with or without an\n\t\taccount path segment as well as cloud endpoints uniformly.\n\n\n\t\tPrevious Release (12.1.2):\n\t\t- updated nuget package dependencies to latest versions (Azure.Storage.Blobs, Azure.Storage.Files.Shares, Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Abstractions, Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection, Microsoft.Extensions.Logging, Microsoft.Extensions.Options.ConfigurationExtensions)\n\t\tand User Delegation SAS for ManagedIdentity/UserToken.",
